Snapshots in this directory (copied, never generated). sync-fixtures.sh --check verifies every
sha256 below on each run of run-tests.sh.

coin.pact, fungible-v2.pact, fungible-xchain-v1.pact, gas-payer-v1.pact
  Kadena's coin contract (a test copy of it) and the fungible-v2, fungible-xchain-v1 and
  gas-payer-v1 interfaces. Not ours: Kadena's, under its BSD-3-Clause licence
  (github.com/kadena-io/chainweb-node). Loaded only so the suite runs with no network.

SPT.pact
  The Smart Pacts Token, n_48867b242317a0216a67f8c7ca26696b5878e0e3.SPT, which trade calls for
  KDA fees (SPT.receive-funding). Its (module SPT …) form is character for character the code
  mainnet01 reports on all 20 chains (read 2026-10-28; module hash
  -wm-9DG1dHz9GdrUqJdDEd7Jb8-XTnOyaFiBY8p7S5Y). The lines outside the module form are its deploy
  transaction's header and table footer. Re-check against the chain at any time:
    python3 .github/scripts/verify-onchain.py --module SPT --file pact/tests/fixtures/SPT.pact

